{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLTIwMTUvU2luZ2glMjBpcyUyMEJsaWluZyUyMCUyODIwMTUlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Singh is Bliing","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/tBkCntLUWwZ0kXDE1DlZBlvLbsK.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9lcxVb5wWj3H3WmBvqBaTPIDNUi.jpg","description":"Raftaar Singh is always looking to have fun and runs away from responsibility. Fed up, his father orders Raftaar to go to Goa and work, and learn to take on responsibility. Once in Goa, he impresses his new boss with his enthusiasm and creative thinking. Soon he gets an assignment, and meets Sara Amy Jackson - and thus begins their unique love story. What ensues is a great comedy of errors, as one hilarious situation after another unfolds. Raftaar falls head over heels for this exotic, mysterious girl. The romance takes a deadly turn when he realizes that Sara is not who he thinks she is and has an agenda, which takes him to Romania. Will Raftaar be able to win her over in a distant and dangerous land?\n\nRated 12A · Released 2 Oct 2015 · India · Language: Hindi · 140 min\nStudio: Eros International, Grazing Goat Pictures\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi","releaseInfo":"2015","genres":["Action","Comedy","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.3","imdb_id":"tt3696192","moviedb_id":283827,"tmdbId":283827,"runtime":"140 min","cast":["Akshay Kumar","Amy Jackson","Rati Agnihotri","Lara Dutta","Kay Kay Menon","Sunny Leone","Kunal Kapoor","Arfi Lamba"],"director":["Prabhu Deva"],"writer":["Prabhu Deva"],"released":"2015-10-02T00:00:00.000Z","country":"India","language":"Hindi","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Prabhu Deva","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lfVxoyweEPkIu6zFa44ajPuSJA1.jpg"},{"name":"Akshay Kumar","character":"Raftaar Singh","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sR8nASRtTpiwXqkFHjG2jdRBZ7a.jpg"},{"name":"Amy Jackson","character":"Sara","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qMWitVFeHAfDTZWcChsWF